      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "Commissioner Anderson made a motion to recommend approval for the Conditional Use Permit for the 8 townhomes. Commissioner Kemp – Can we say that they will build as close as they can to the renderings that were provided? Commissioner Fisher – We should say that they build what has been presented. Commissioner Anderson – I will amend my motion to include that they build what has been presented.",
