      "motion_no": 2,
      "section": "",
      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "Commissioner Anderson made a motion to recommend approval to City Council of the zone change as presented. Bryan Pack – I think the motion needs to make it clear that the details of the other areas are not being approved for tonight. Dan Boles – In the motion it does state that only areas 1, 2, and 10 are approved for conceptual site elevations and that all other planned developments not approved will be required to come back for a secondary zone change. Commissioner Fisher – Is that something you agree to? Commissioner Anderson – Yes Chair Draper – And do we still have a second? Commissioner Kemp – Yes Dan Boles – And just to make sure I’m clear, you are recommending approval of the resort overlay in those two areas? Commissioner Anderson - Yes",
